      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but when you say \"non-distracting,\" i want to be very specific. i'm working with a diverse group of executives. can you give me some more concrete examples of hair styles that are considered \"standard\" for an authoritative look? like, what specific textures or styles should they aim for to avoid looking too casual or unprofessional?",
